msgstr "Confirm Before Disabling Update Check"

#: app/setting_interface.py:3030
msgid ""
"仍然建议保留“启动时检测更新”。\n"
"\n"
"它不会在后台偷偷自动更新软件。开启后，仅会在你手动启动软件时检查一次更新，并在发现新版本后提醒你，不会自行安装，也不会影响循环运行。\n"
"\n"
"这类基于图像识别的工具对游戏界面变化非常敏感。游戏更新后，界面、按钮或布局只要发生变化，旧版本就更容易出现识别失败、流程异常等问题。\n"
"\n"
"很多看似“突然不能用了”的情况，本质上都是版本过旧导致的。若你已经了解这些影响，再继续关闭更新检测。"
msgstr ""
"It is still recommended to keep \"Check Update on Launch\" enabled.\n"
"\n"
"This feature does not secretly auto-update the app in the background. When enabled, it only checks once when you manually start the app and notifies you if a new version is available. It does not install anything by itself and does not interfere with loop runs.\n"
"\n"
"Tools based on image recognition are very sensitive to UI changes. After the game updates, even small changes to layouts, buttons, or screens can cause older versions to fail recognition or behave unexpectedly.\n"
"\n"
"Many cases that look like the app \"suddenly stopped working\" are actually caused by using an outdated version. If you understand these implications, you can continue disabling update checks."

#: app/setting_interface.py:3033
msgid "我已了解，继续关闭"
msgstr "I Understand, Disable Anyway"

#: app/setting_interface.py:2578
msgid "更新时下载完整包"
msgstr "Download Full Package Update"

#: app/setting_interface.py:2579
