#: app/schedule_dialog.py:465
msgid ""
"按时启动：在选中的星期到达设定时间后，直接启动当前任务，星期按电脑本地日期判断。\n"
"链式启动：不会单独按时间触发，需要放在前一个任务后面；当前一个任务正常结束后，会按列表顺序立即启动，不单独判断星期。\n"
"立即运行：不受星期限制，从当前任务开始，后面连续的链式任务也会跟随执行。"
msgstr ""
"Scheduled start: Start the current task at the set time on the selected days, based on the computer's local date.\n"
"Chained start: Does not start independently at a set time. Place it after another task. When the preceding task finishes normally, chained tasks start immediately in list order, without checking the day of the week.\n"
"Run now: Ignores day-of-week restrictions. Starts the current task and then runs any consecutive chained tasks that follow."

