#: app/card/uac_free_setting_card.py:49
msgid "开启免 UAC 运行前请确认"
msgstr "Confirm before enabling execution without UAC prompts"

#: app/card/uac_free_setting_card.py:50
msgid ""
"开启后，AI 助手或脚本通过 m7a.exe 运行任务时，不会再弹出“你要允许此应用对你的设备进行更改吗？”的确认窗口。你不在电脑前时，也能让 AI 助手帮你远程运行任务。\n"
"\n"
"这个确认窗口原本是 Windows 的一道安全防线，开启前请了解：\n"
"\n"
"• 这台电脑上以你的账户运行的其他程序（包括 AI 助手执行的命令），也能借助小助手获得管理员权限，不再需要你点“是”。\n"
"• 如果电脑中了病毒，或者有人冒用你的 AI 助手，造成的损害可能会更大。\n"
"• 只对当前 Windows 账户和当前安装目录生效；更新小助手后不用重新开启，移动安装目录后需要重新开启。\n"
"• 远程运行时，电脑需要保持开机、已登录并且没有锁屏。\n"
"\n"
"建议只在自己的电脑上、并且信任所用的 AI 助手时开启。不需要时，随时可以回到这里关闭。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, AI assistants and scripts running tasks through m7a.exe will no longer trigger the \"Do you want to allow this app to make changes to your device?\" confirmation prompt. This lets an AI assistant run tasks remotely even when you are away from your computer.\n"
"\n"
"This prompt is a Windows security safeguard. Before enabling this feature, please understand:\n"
"\n"
"• Other programs running under your account on this computer (including commands executed by AI assistants) can also use the assistant to gain administrator privileges without you clicking \"Yes\".\n"
"• If your computer is infected with malware or someone misuses your AI assistant, the potential damage may be greater.\n"
"• This applies only to the current Windows account and installation directory. You do not need to enable it again after updating the assistant, but you must do so after moving the installation directory.\n"
"• For remote execution, the computer must remain powered on, signed in, and unlocked.\n"
"\n"
"Only enable this on your own computer and with an AI assistant you trust. You can return here and disable it at any time when you no longer need it."

