"cannot run. Check antivirus blocking and directory permissions: {error}"

#: app/setting_interface.py:2485
msgid "后台操作遇到鼠标干扰时会等待并重试；下次启动任务生效。"
msgstr ""
"Background operations wait and retry when the mouse is busy. Applies to the "
"next task."

#: app/setting_interface.py:3008
msgid ""
"后台模式下，任务运行时你可以继续使用电脑，但仍有以下限制：\n"
"\n"
"• 点击和拖动会短暂借用鼠标，完成后归还；你正在移动鼠标时，任务会等鼠标停下再操作。\n"
"• 在大世界中按键时，光标会被短暂锁定在游戏窗口中央。\n"
"• 游戏窗口可以放在其他窗口后面，但不能最小化；运行期间请保持系统解锁。\n"
"• 锄大地、第三方模拟宇宙等独立程序不受此设置影响，仍需前台运行。\n"
"\n"
"设置在下次启动任务时生效，自动对话需重新开启。完整说明见使用文档“后台运行”。"
msgstr ""
"In background mode you can keep using your computer while tasks run, with these limitations:\n"
"\n"
"• Clicks and drags briefly borrow the mouse and return it afterwards; while you are moving the mouse, the task waits for it to stop.\n"
"• Key presses in the open world briefly lock the cursor to the center of the game window.\n"
"• The game window can stay behind other windows but must not be minimized; keep the system unlocked while tasks run.\n"
"• Standalone programs such as Fhoe-Rail and third-party Simulated Universe tools are not affected by this setting and still need the foreground.\n"
"\n"
"The setting takes effect the next time a task starts; turn Auto Dialogue off and on again to apply it. See \"Background Running\" in the documentation for details."

