msgid ""
"用数据线连接手机，并在开发者选项里打开“USB 调试”。模拟器请在“Android 设备”里输入地址连接，MuMu 默认是 "
"127.0.0.1:16384。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the phone with a cable and turn on \"USB debugging\" in Developer "
"options. For an emulator, enter its address under \"Android device\". MuMu "
"uses 127.0.0.1:16384 by default."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:153
msgid "检测到多台设备，请在“Android 设备”里选择要使用的那一台。"
msgstr ""
"Several devices were found. Choose the one to use under \"Android device\"."

