msgid "设备已连接但还不能使用。重新插拔数据线或重启模拟器，然后点“刷新”。"
msgstr ""
"The device is connected but not ready. Replug the cable or restart the "
"emulator, then click \"Refresh\"."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:155
msgid "ADB 模式需要 Android 10 或更高版本，请换一台设备，或改用模拟器。"
msgstr ""
"ADB mode requires Android 10 or later. Use another device or an emulator."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:156
msgid "读不到设备的屏幕分辨率。解锁设备并保持亮屏后重试。"
msgstr ""
"Could not read the device's screen resolution. Unlock the device, keep the "
"screen on, then try again."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:157
msgid "请在“高级设置”里重新选择设备类型。"
msgstr "Choose the device type again under \"Advanced settings\"."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:158
msgid "在模拟器设置里把分辨率改成 1280×720（横屏、240 DPI），重启模拟器后重试。"
msgstr ""
"Set the resolution to 1280×720 (landscape, 240 DPI) in the emulator "
"settings, restart the emulator, then try again."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:159
msgid "这台模拟器的 Android 版本低于 14，不能直接使用模拟器画面。请在“高级设置”里把设备类型改回“自动判断”。"
msgstr ""
"This emulator runs Android below 14, so its screen cannot be used directly. "
"Set the device type back to \"Automatic\" under \"Advanced settings\"."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:161
msgid "在设备上安装国服《崩坏：星穹铁道》，并先手动登录一次账号。"
msgstr ""
"Install the mainland China edition of Honkai: Star Rail on the device and "
"sign in once manually."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:162
msgid ""
"缺少设备端服务文件。请重新解压完整的程序包；从源码运行时先在 Android 目录执行 gradlew :device-"
"service:assemble。"
msgstr ""
"The device service file is missing. Extract the complete package again. When"
" running from source, run gradlew :device-service:assemble in the Android "
"folder first."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:164
msgid "设备正被另一个任务占用，或上一次运行还在收尾。等十几秒后重试；有任务在运行时先等它结束。"
msgstr ""
"The device is in use by another task, or the previous run is still cleaning "
"up. Wait ten to twenty seconds and try again. If a task is running, wait for"
" it to finish."

#: app/tools/adb_service.py:166
msgid "设备端服务没能启动。重新插拔数据线后重试，仍然失败时重启设备。"
msgstr ""
"The device service failed to start. Replug the cable and try again. If it "
"still fails, restart the device."

