msgid "系统拒绝了触摸注入。小米、红米手机请在开发者选项里打开“USB 调试（安全设置）”，其他品牌请打开名称相近的开关，然后重新插拔数据线。"
msgstr ""
"The system denied touch input. On Xiaomi and Redmi phones, turn on \"USB "
"debugging (Security settings)\" in Developer options. On other brands, turn "
"on the similarly named switch. Then replug the cable."

